<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51824" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθιζάνω</span></b> , 
			Aeol.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατισδάνω</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Sapph.
			<u>Supp.</u>
			19.5
		</span></i>, irreg. impf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκαθίζανον </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρ-</span>) <i><span class="en">
			<u>IG</u>
			22.1011.22
		</span></i><span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sit down</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θῶκόνδε
				καθίζανον</span>
			<i>they went</i> to the council <i>and took their seats</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάντις ἐς θρόνους κ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				29
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρά τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Polyaen.
					8.64
				</span></i>
			: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σὺ δὲ καθίζανε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pherecr.
					172
				</span></i>
			; of bees, birds, etc., <i>settle, perch</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλιτταν ἐφ᾽ ἅπαντα βλαστήματα
					καθιζάνουσαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					1.52
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				601a7
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ δονάκων, πέτραις</span>,
			ib. <i><span class="en">
				593b10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				619b8
			</span></i>.</div>
